          "message": "ci: Use runs-on/action to properly configure runs-on's caching (#6195)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nThis is the proper way to configure runs-on's cache that makes it work\nwithout us having to use workarounds for artifact uploads.\nhttps://runs-on.com/docs/performance/caching/actions/\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Philippe No\u00ebl <philippemnoel@gmail.com>",
