          "id": "d951b1ac1187e1709ad5a0afb42e84668ca322c4",
          "message": "chore: bump rustls to 0.23.46 for the cargo-audit failure (#6815)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- None.\n\n## What\n\nBumps rustls from 0.23.45 to 0.23.46 in `Cargo.lock`.\n\n## Why\n\nRustSec published four advisories against rustls 0.23.45 today\n(RUSTSEC-2026-0346, 0347, 0348 and 0349), so the `cargo audit` step of\nthe lint job fails on every PR since 14:16 UTC. All four name 0.23.46 as\nthe fix. Same situation as #6330, one version later.\n\n## How\n\n`cargo update -p rustls`. Only rustls moves; no other crate re-resolves.\nrustls is transitive (lindera-dictionary \u2192 ureq, used at build time to\ndownload dictionaries), so no pg_search code changes. The `cargoHash` in\n`nix/pg_search.nix` is left for the bot to update.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `cargo audit` (cargo-audit 0.22.2, installed as in the lint workflow):\nexits 1 on `main`, exits 0 on this branch with the 7 allowed warnings\nfrom `.cargo/audit.toml`.\n- Pre-commit: fmt, clippy, rustdoc, machete and taplo all pass.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-bot[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
