          "id": "ad5ba343cf1d286cac9ede03e01656fc6508a4e3",
          "message": "perf: optimised to use doc_count when count aggregate key matches with GROUP BY key (#6707)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #6705\n\n## What\n\n## Why\n\n`COUNT(col)` where `col` is the GROUP BY key ran a separate value_count\nsub-aggregation per bucket.\n\n## How\n\nReuse the bucket's `doc_count` instead (NULL-key bucket reports 0).\n\n## Tests\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Philippe No\u00ebl <21990816+philippemnoel@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Philippe No\u00ebl <21990816+philippemnoel@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Moe <mdashti@gmail.com>",
