          "id": "44dd9f4a37a8b65b7e72cf9d0f91352bb84155f9",
          "message": "refactor(vector)!: remove the graph router and adopt tantivy's vector setup (#6802)\n\nMoves pg_search onto tantivy's vector setup and removes the graph\nrouter.\n- Pins tantivy to `52e6862d111c419219ed94cad7d03f08e8090897`.\n- IVF segments use tantivy's `SuperKMeansClusterer` with the index's\n`max_leaf_size` and `training_sample_ratio`, and the stacked router.\npg_search's own clusterer and the `vector_router` option are removed.\n- Quantization seeds, the fixed probe cost and the probe defaults come\nfrom tantivy.\n\n**Upgrading.** Indexes whose IVF segments were built with the graph\nrouter, the previous default, must be rebuilt: vector queries fail with\na REINDEX hint and merges skip those segments until then; text search is\nunaffected. An index created with `vector_router` set needs `ALTER INDEX\n\u2026 RESET (vector_router)` before `ALTER INDEX \u2026 SET`, pg_dump or\npg_upgrade.\n\nRegress: the 10 `vector_*` files passed with unchanged expected output\nagainst the previous PR 11; `vector_router` is deleted. This revision\npasses `cargo check`, clippy and `cargo metadata --locked`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-bot[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
