          "id": "f94f9156f631eae41bd9fd938bcda9ba668d372f",
          "message": "chore: pin Tantivy to buffered-union seek_danger fix (#6958)\n\n## Summary\n- Bump the synchronized Tantivy / tantivy-common / tantivy-tokenizer-api\nGit pins from `dd6c6003` to `dc37e703`\n([paradedb/tantivy#339](https://github.com/paradedb/tantivy/pull/339)).\n- That commit disables the buggy `BufferedUnionScorer::seek_danger`\noverride (upstream\n[#3086](https://github.com/quickwit-oss/tantivy/issues/3086) /\n[#3088](https://github.com/quickwit-oss/tantivy/pull/3088)).\n- Requested by review on the Tantivy PR so `benchmarker` can validate\nbefore landing.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo metadata --locked --format-version 1` (all Tantivy Git\npackages resolve to `dc37e703`)\n- [x] Run CI / `benchmarker` against this branch\n- [x] Confirm no unexpected regressions on filter \u2229 disjunction-max\nstyle query workloads\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Stu Hood <stuhood@paradedb.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-bot[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Stu Hood <stuhood@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Stu Hood <stuhood@paradedb.com>",
